# Environment files - NEVER commit these!
# ⚠ The narrow list above (.env.local, .env.production.local, ...) let two files
# through: ".env copy.local" (a Finder duplicate — note the space) and ".env.local.dev".
# Both carried live HandCash, GitHub and X app secrets in a PUBLIC repo. Match broadly.
.env
.env.*
.env*
*.env
.env copy.local
.env.deployment
!.env.example
